# AX.25 v2.2 frame (TAPR, sections 3 and 4): the address field (destination, source, up to eight
# repeaters), the control field (modulo 8), the PID and the information field. The message is the frame
# between the flags, without the frame-check sequence. Written by tools/gen/radio-pack.py.
format        ax25-frame
version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "TAPR, AX.25 Link Access Protocol for Amateur Packet Radio, Version 2.2, Revision July 1998, sections 3 and 4, http://www.tapr.org/pdf/AX25.2.2.pdf as archived 2025-02-23 (sha256 af2070954468ef6498143ababf9beaf5d72b683ef82491dd7eb8e3670b29475c), Copyright TAPR and ARRL, no licence stated; layout restated"
uses          ax25
wire          bits
layout        sequential
bit_order     msb

field  ax25.dest_call_1  7  chars:ascii7
pad  1
field  ax25.dest_call_2  7  chars:ascii7
pad  1
field  ax25.dest_call_3  7  chars:ascii7
pad  1
field  ax25.dest_call_4  7  chars:ascii7
pad  1
